"Some specification limits or target value are outside of the support of the "
"Johnson (SB) transform. The bounds of the transform were identified to "
"between %1$f and %2$f."
msgstr ""
"規格限界または目標値の一部が Johnson (SB) 変換の台の外にあります。この変換の"
"境界は %1$f から %2$f と特定されました。"

